There’s a shift happening in how Pune buys homes. Where a 2 BHK once felt sufficient, more families today are moving straight to 3 and 4 BHK luxury residences, and it isn’t just about square footage. It’s about space that keeps pace with how people actually live now: working from home some days, hosting family often, and wanting a home that feels like a retreat rather than just a place to sleep. At Kumar World, this shift is exactly what shaped Kumar Prism Towers.
A 3 or 4 BHK isn’t simply a bigger version of a smaller flat. Done right, it’s a home with a dedicated study or work-from-home corner, a guest room that doesn’t double as storage, and a living area spacious enough to actually entertain in. At Kumar Prism Towers, our 3 BHK residences span 1,335 sq. ft. and our 4 BHK homes extend to 1,722 sq. ft., giving families the breathing room to grow into the home rather than out of it.
Designed by International Talent, Built for Everyday Life
Every residence at Kumar Prism Towers is shaped by international designers, with interiors that balance style and function. Homes come with modular kitchens, centralised air conditioning, home automation, and video door phones with digital locks, features that go beyond aesthetics to make daily life genuinely easier. The building itself carries a gold-rated green certification, so the luxury on offer doesn’t come at the planet’s expense.
Amenities That Turn a Building Into a Lifestyle
What truly sets a luxury home apart is everything that exists beyond its four walls. At Kumar Prism Towers, residents step into a clubhouse on the 34th level with panoramic views, alongside a rooftop gym, yoga deck, and open-air theatre. There’s a zen garden and aroma garden for quiet mornings, a star-gazing deck for evenings, and a dedicated senior citizens’ area for the family members who deserve a peaceful corner of their own. Families with young children have a full kids’ play area and pet park to look forward to, while a swimming pool, jacuzzi, box cricket space, and party lawn round out a space built for every kind of resident, and every kind of day.
A 3.5-Acre Address at Magarpatta, Mundhwa
Luxury living also depends on where you come home to. Kumar Prism Towers sits on a 3.5-acre landscape on Hadapsar Road, Magarpatta, Mundhwa, just three minutes from Seasons Mall and Amanora Mall, five minutes from Magarpatta IT Park, and within easy reach of Pune Airport and Kalyani Nagar Metro. It’s a location that lets residents enjoy resort-style living without stepping away from the city’s pace.
